AeroStruct-15MW

This project uses public reference inputs from the IEA Wind Systems
IEA-15-240-RWT repository when the user runs scripts/fetch_reference_data.py.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/IEAWindSystems/IEA-15-240-RWT

The upstream reference data are not claimed as original work of this project.
The download script retains the upstream LICENSE alongside fetched files.

Technical reference:
Gaertner et al., "Definition of the IEA 15-Megawatt Offshore Reference Wind Turbine",
NREL/TP-5000-75698, 2020.
